Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:28.77,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(833.208,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.09,0:01:28.82,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(896.604,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:28.87,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:28.92,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1023.396,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:28.97,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1086.792,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.91,0:22:53.92,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いつもひとりで歩いてた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.92,0:23:01.46,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}振り返るとみんなは遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:09.07,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでもあたしは歩いた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:14.74,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それが強さだった
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.51,0:23:22.57,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}もう何も恐くない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.11,0:23:31.11,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}そう呟いてみせる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:42.29,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いつか人は一人になって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:49.96,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}思い出の中に生きてくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.96,0:23:57.76,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}孤独さえ愛し笑ってられるように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:24:04.58,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}あたしは戦うんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.30,0:24:12.94,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}涙なんて見せないんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.91,0:22:53.92,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一路走來形單影隻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.92,0:23:01.46,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}轉身回望大家已經遠去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:09.07,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使如此我依然前行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:14.74,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這曾是我的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.51,0:23:22.57,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我已無所畏懼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.11,0:23:31.11,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}總是這樣輕聲提醒自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:42.29,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}總有一天  人將學會獨立
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:49.96,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在回憶中尋找自己的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.96,0:23:57.76,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}為了那笑容下與孤獨作伴的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:24:04.58,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我選擇了戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.30,0:24:12.94,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不再流下眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.52,0:24:20.32,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,960)\fad(100,100)}為什麼新歌是敘事曲？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.56,0:24:20.57,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,960)\fad(100,100)}請叫我Kleist
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.31,0:24:21.65,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,1050)\fad(100,100)}沒能唱喜歡的歌曲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.63,0:24:22.35,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,1050)\fad(100,100)}真的很有氣魄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.93,0:24:24.19,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,1050)\fad(100,100)}就是天使的住所
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:26.06,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,960)\fad(100,100)}還有還有  更燃的是Alchemy  Alchemy啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.40,0:24:23.10,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,1050)\fad(100,100)}沒有記憶的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:24.34,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,1050)\fad(100,100)}那你說到底是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.00,0:24:25.88,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,870)\fad(100,100)}最糟糕的設定
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.90,0:24:26.32,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,870)\fad(100,100)}天使出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.50,0:24:26.84,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)\fad(100,100)}虧我還稍微對你們的看法有些改觀了的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.16,0:24:27.12,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,960)\fad(100,100)}到此為止了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.86,0:24:30.72,next,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)\fad(100,100)}不要碰它！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:35.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高松  請開始報告
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來自武器庫的報告說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:41.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彈藥的儲備即將告罄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.71,0:01:44.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下次交戰之前需要進行補給
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有新人的加入  也需要新的槍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.99,0:01:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.99,0:01:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的作戰計劃為「Guild空降作戰」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空  空降作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.53,0:02:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  音無
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比較怕高…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊  又不是從空中空降
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.91,0:02:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是從這裡往地下「空降」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  原來是地下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地下？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在地下深處有被我們稱作「Guild」的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:19.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夥伴們在那裡製造著武器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:22.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是為了不讓天使發現嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.21,0:02:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  如果失去Guild的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒了武器支援  勝算也就無從談起了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:34.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我  今晚會過去你們那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:35.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請解除掉陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解  是今晚吧  我們等著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.93,0:02:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次行動的成員就在場的各位吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.57,0:02:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  不用管野田了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個笨蛋肯定又是在單獨行動了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All  right  Let's  Go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預備
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:56.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  別傻站著  走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這  這裡面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.11,0:03:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是入口啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:22.91,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久沒來Guild了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:25.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好黑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  有人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是叫音無吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒有認可你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不明白他特意等在這裡有什麼意義
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野田他很愛搞這種「排場」的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也沒想被你認可
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙  這次讓你死1000遍！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:58.00,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,一路走來…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.17,0:04:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陷阱沒有解除嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就如你所看見的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:13.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在通向Guild的路上有許多用於對付天使的致命陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而所有的這些東西現在依舊在運行著
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.97,0:04:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘記解除陷阱了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想讓我們全滅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是Guild擅自讓陷阱再次運行起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天使出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Just  wild  heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失策
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Guild的人是知道我們在這裡還這樣做的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還沒理解啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管發生什麼  我們都不會死
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然會有死時的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才討厭的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:50.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果Guild的位置暴露並被攻陷的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就無法補充彈藥和修理壞掉的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的話我們又如何去和天使戰鬥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:04:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Guild的判斷是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去追天使吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在陷阱沒有解除的這裡面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天使就交給這些陷阱吧  我們回去好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.79,0:05:09.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陷阱只不過能拖延一會兒時間罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們追
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前進
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:17.46,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B3
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.81,0:05:28.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來有些什麼樣的陷阱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.29,0:05:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各種各樣的都有哦  你就好好期待著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:35.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不妙  要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.73,0:05:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh  my  crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:55.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊  快點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:08.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高松的聲音  他被幹掉了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了高松  大家都平安無事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:12.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用去救他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又不會死
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不去管  他也能自己逃出來跑回地面的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:19.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:20.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才多虧你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小事一樁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我挺中意你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:34.65,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B6
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能打開嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然不能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕  我忘記了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是個封閉陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別忘記這麼重要的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:44.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是膚淺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險的東西要過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.06,0:06:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快躲開
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰到那個會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.07,0:07:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會漂亮地把身體切成兩半
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:06.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二波來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:08.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓它穿過去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三波來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三波是什麼來著
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X型
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玩意怎麼躲開啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己想辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:19.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快開啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,門開了  趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次犧牲的是松下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個體型的確沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該減減肥了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到世界末日了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙剛好就在他眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒死在我眼前真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順便說下即使被切成片過一段時間也能復原的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:58.71,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B8
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:02.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陷阱發動了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕  我忘記了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:06.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是天花板會壓下來的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說不要忘記這麼重要的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hurry  up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在還來得及
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh  快飛越過去  緊緊擁抱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:18.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回頭見
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:20.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連TK也犧牲了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你們犧牲他的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說不會有事的啦  沒關係沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓他白白犧牲  我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:43.57,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B9
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕  我忘記了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說不要忘記這種事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:58.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太重了  要堅持不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和音無都下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:03.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  別擅自決定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡一下子失去戰力絕不是上策
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  快點爬上來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音無  能行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能上了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是S吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少囉嗦  接下來是肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什麼啊  別停下快點上去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.74,0:09:31.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我該抓哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡都行啊  隨你便了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:39.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣會掉下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這傢伙會這麼香
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.31,0:09:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不爬上去的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你的臉會朝著這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能…能快點爬嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼能抓那種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…日向呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光榮犧牲了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩四個人了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個新人居然能堅持到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個就是你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水淹嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:39.26,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B13
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙原來是旱鴨子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口在這邊  跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.99,0:10:54.51,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B15
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.09,0:11:05.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百合  這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椎名同學
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:08.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.27,0:11:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會有那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.55,0:11:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小狗要被沖走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椎名同學  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失策  這居然是玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連椎名同學也中了陷阱犧牲了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也是對付天使的陷阱嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:43.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說請第一眼就看出來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.37,0:11:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對可愛的東西沒轍是她的弱點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊  還是有可愛的地方的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.05,0:11:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是她也沒事的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:00.95,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B17
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真是在打仗的話  不是已經全軍覆沒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是沒用的領袖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟是用來對付天使的陷阱  不這樣的話就沒意義了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的也是  衣服也要晾乾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.32,0:12:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真虧你能把那樣一群人統率起來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你會被選為領袖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是第一個開始反抗的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反抗天使嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾有過弟弟和妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說的是你所沒有的生前記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:53.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來到這個世界之前…活著的時候的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:58.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算上我一共四個兄弟姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.07,0:13:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是長女  下面有兩個妹妹一個弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:08.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父母的事業有成  是個非常富裕的家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生活在一個被自然包圍  別墅一般的房子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那個暑假  一個父母不在家的午後
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幾個陌生男人闖進了家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是盛夏卻帶著面罩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.67,0:13:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一看就知道是來做壞事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心想作為長女必須保護好弟弟妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但怎麼可能是對手呢  對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們雖然是圖財而來的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在他們沒能找到的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就開始亂砸窗戶和電視機
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逐漸焦躁了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後他們想到了對我們姐妹來說最惡毒的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.99,0:13:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小妹妹  你是長女
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:14:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家裡重要的東西物品放在哪裡應該告訴過你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地震的話就帶上那個逃跑什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有強盜來的話就交出那個讓他們離開什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該有告訴過你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  我不知道那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.41,0:14:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  去找出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果東西不能讓我們滿意的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然讓人覺得悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.81,0:14:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你就得和這些孩子一個接一個地告別了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每10分鐘一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每10分鐘帶一個東西過來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我開始拼命在家裡尋找
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頭疼得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得噁心  差點倒下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:41.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這關係到那些孩子的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須得找出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.76,0:14:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是根本不知道他們想要的值錢的東西是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時間要…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不趕快的話  不趕快的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把這個最大的花瓶拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:15:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好重  既然那麼重的話一定很值錢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等警察趕到已經是30分鐘以後的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:24.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活下來的只有我一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我並不是介意自己是否會變成水蚤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只覺得如果神真的存在的話  我就要反抗他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為太沒道理了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明沒做什麼壞事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到那天為止我都有自信成為一個好姐姐的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要保護的一切只用30分鐘就被奪走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒這麼不講道理的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼能原諒這種人生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:15:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真堅強啊  百合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我也有這樣的記憶的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定早就想快點消失算了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.81,0:16:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是百合卻選擇了反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  我能問一件事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百合是怎麼死的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋  我不是自殺的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會自殺的人不可能會反抗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:24.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且這個世界也不存在自殺的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:28.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你由我來保護
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是Guild？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.66,0:16:52.81,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild最底層
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小百合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.05,0:17:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平安抵達了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:09.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他們在這裡製造著武器嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.89,0:17:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿過那些陷阱  平安到達這裡了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是小百合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:15.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說這些了  天使呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然剛才停止了前進  但現在似乎又開始動了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又中陷阱了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:30.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很近
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小百合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你瘋了嗎  小百合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯啊  無法製造武器也沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的不是地點和道具  而是記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們都忘了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事  百合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這個世界不會誕生有生命的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但卻能誕生只有形狀的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:57.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要知道構成的原理和製作的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:17:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實是不需要其他東西的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:01.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算用土塊也能做得出來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不知從何時起變得以效率為先
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在都完全是在這個工廠中不斷生產複製品了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.93,0:18:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙也是高中生嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:17.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來我們是用記憶給只有形狀的東西注入靈魂的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就前往Old  Guild吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被廢棄很久的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡雖然什麼都沒有  但是土塊的話有一大堆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:28.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從那裡的話也能回到地上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:28.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爆破掉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓天使進入Old  Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡是我們唯一的歸宿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:40.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要帶走的東西只有記憶和作為職人的尊嚴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有這些
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不對  小子們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.09,0:18:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  開始安裝炸藥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展現團隊精神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:58.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒有下一個陷阱了  抓緊時間
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百合  你去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.19,0:19:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拖延時間
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.55,0:19:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不害怕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:21.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算留在下面也幫不上什麼忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.58,0:19:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「guard  skill」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「distortion」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.98,0:19:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應變也太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害  她近身戰也這麼行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,填裝炮彈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:19:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種地方用不會出問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管了  快幹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快快  你們平時的力氣都到哪裡去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「guard  skill」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「delay」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音無
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.27,0:20:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們兩人快閃開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.95,0:20:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們還是挺能幹的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.15,0:20:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種東西可不是隨便就能做出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.23,0:20:42.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音無  到這邊來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全員退避
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開炮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炮台毀了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:21:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然在記憶中不存在的東西不好隨便做出來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要隨便做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天使要起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:05.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們幾個  用這個挺住
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快撤到掩體裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.65,0:21:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  爆破Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爆破
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經好幾年沒回來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.72,0:21:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是什麼都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:48.80,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1710,750)}Old  Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.75,0:21:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捅牆壁的話會有很多土塊掉下來的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個淒慘的巢穴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.49,0:21:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.37,0:21:52.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.51,0:21:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  那就快點開始吧  小子們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋們  都醒了沒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.86,0:22:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Guild廢棄  和天使一起爆破掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.45,0:22:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通告全體人員  立刻到Old  Guild來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器的補充在那裡迅速進行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在天使復活前全員到Old  Guild來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.84,0:22:15.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再重複一遍  快點  笨蛋們
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地救了她
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.85,0:22:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只覺得如果神真的存在的話  我就要反抗他
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為太沒道理了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.06,0:22:30.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太讓人不甘心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:34.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.53,0:22:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難怪大家會跟著你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是個不錯的領袖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
